===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Anything which [[radiate]]s or emits rays.
# {{lb|en|automotive}} A device that lowers engine coolant temperature by conducting heat to the air, through metal fins.
# {{lb|en|of buildings}} A finned metal fixture that carries hot water or steam in order to heat a room.
# {{lb|en|electronics}} A type of antenna.

